  clientName: Mills
  jobDescription: Complete the 150-meter gap in a corridor connecting Ironhaven more
    directly with Rivermere and the route toward Canyon Crossing. Design a bridge
    that meets the site's requirements and carries the required test vehicle safely
    across. Apply the lessons from earlier projects, review the results, and improve
    any weak connections before returning to Mills.
